# Root directory to scan for AAHP projects.
# Defaults to <home>/Workspace when unset (~/Workspace on macOS/Linux,
# %USERPROFILE%\Workspace on Windows).
#
# Pick the example for your platform and uncomment one of these lines:
#
#   macOS:    ROOT_DIR=/Users/yourname/Workspace
#   Linux:    ROOT_DIR=/home/yourname/Workspace
#   Windows:  ROOT_DIR=C:\Users\yourname\Workspace
#
# Forward slashes also work on Windows (Node.js normalises them):
#   ROOT_DIR=C:/Users/yourname/Workspace

# Path to the aahp-runner metrics JSONL file.
# Defaults to <home>/.aahp/metrics.jsonl on every platform.
# METRICS_FILE=

# Path to the aahp-runner live sessions file.
# Defaults to <home>/.aahp/sessions.json on every platform.
# Written by aahp-runner / aahp-orchestrator. The hub reads this for the
# running-agent view, the SSE stream, and the controlPort needed by Abort.
# SESSIONS_FILE=
